/TU (The image depicts a process for refining process mining use cases. It starts with traditional and advanced process mining techniques, moving through a stage where the research team and literature contribute to use case transfer and evolution. This is followed by expert interviews from both process mining and supply chain management. Finally, the use cases are filtered and refined with experts, focusing on realism, value-add, implementation, and data availability, resulting in a final set of refined use cases.)
